{"path":"/case-studies/grata/","slug":"case-studies__grata","kind":"case-study","title":"Grata Case Study: A Webflow component system for Grata Intelligence | Legency Media","description":"Grata Intelligence brings deal sourcing, company data and AI into an M&A workspace. Its marketing website needed to carry the new brand across product, data and company pages while giving the team a consistent way to build and edit content.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/_slug_.CjSPQXea.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"cs-hero\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container cs-hero__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"cs-hero__lead\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Case Study</span><span class=\"cs-hero__client\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Grata</span><h1 class=\"cs-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>A Webflow component system for Grata Intelligence</h1><aside class=\"side-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"side-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h2 data-no-roll class=\"side-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Our role</h2><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"side-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Webflow development of Funsize’s designs, with reusable sections, native editing controls and CMS publishing.</p></aside></div><figure class=\"cs-hero__media\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><img class=\"case-visual\" src=\"/img/case-studies/grata-photo-1440.webp\" srcset=\"/img/case-studies/grata-photo-800.webp 800w, /img/case-studies/grata-photo-1440.webp 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 94vw, 45vw\" alt=\"Grata Intelligence homepage on an Apple Studio Display in a contemporary meeting room.\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1008\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-iavcwzwr><figcaption data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Grata Intelligence. Webflow development and component system. Staging build.<span class=\"cs-credit\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Designed by <a href=\"https://www.funsize.co/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Funsize</a>.</span><span class=\"cs-credit\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Staging preview. The image shows the review build.</span></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><dl class=\"cs-stats\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><dt data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>reusable section families</dt><dd data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>19</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class=\"challenge\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container challenge__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Challenge</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"challenge__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Building a website the marketing team can maintain.</h2></div><div class=\"challenge__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Grata Intelligence brings deal sourcing, company data and AI into an M&amp;A workspace. Its marketing website needed to carry the new brand across product, data and company pages while giving the team a consistent way to build and edit content.</p><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><a href=\"https://www.funsize.co/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Funsize</a> supplied the website designs. Working from those designs, Legency Media developed the Webflow implementation and its shared section system. The work also covers responsive interactions, resource publishing and the Blueflame product page.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"solution section\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container solution__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"solution__lead\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Solution</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"solution__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The work we delivered.</h2></div><div class=\"solution__cards\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Reusable page sections</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Developed 19 section families with native controls for content, imagery, layout and spacing. Marketing editors can choose wide or medium content widths and configure repeated cards and panels within the existing design.</p></article><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>CMS publishing</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Connected resource cards to dedicated thumbnail fields, keeping card artwork separate from article heroes and social images. Existing content and editorial states were preserved through the updates.</p></article><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Responsive motion</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Implemented the supplied interactions, responsive layouts and an editable motion library with static poster fallbacks for reduced motion.</p></article><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Shared site structure</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M13 10V3L5 14H11V21L19 10H13Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Built shared navigation and footer updates, carried the new visual direction through supporting pages and connected the Blueflame product page to the site’s navigation and redirects.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"outcome\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"outcome__head\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Outcome</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"outcome__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Delivered for launch review.</h2></div><div class=\"outcome__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>A consistent editing system</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The developed section library gives the marketing team labelled controls for everyday page updates. Native editing checks and compiled desktop and mobile reviews verify the delivered behaviour.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Staged implementation</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The redesigned pages and component system are available on Grata’s staging site. This case study shows the development delivered as of 14 October 2026; production launch and subsequent performance results are not yet reported.</p></article></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".cs-hero .label,.challenge .label,.solution .label,.work-hero .label{color:#625e5e}.site-footer .closer__scene{filter:grayscale()}.case-visual[data-astro-cid-iavcwzwr]{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n.icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);height:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);background:var(--blue);color:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);flex-shrink:0;place-items:center;display:grid}.icon-chip--on-dark[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{background:#ffffff1a;border:1px solid #ffffff47}.icon-c